1. lao_shield_unchanged.inp: shielding is calculated in a standard way

2. lao_shield_rearranged.inp: shielding is calculated from rearranged equations

3. lao_shield_lr_rearranged_lih.out: shielding is calculated from rearranged equations and in addition the linear response equations are modified to be connection-independent (here all formulation is connection-independent) 

